OL,3,GNEWSAMen who raped girl, 14, have jail
OL,4,Aterms increased
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men who raped a 14-year-old girl
OL,7,Fafter she went missing from home have
OL,8,Fhad their prison sentences increased.
OL,10,FDaryl German, 43, Jordan Doneley Wint,
OL,11,F31, and Deon Smith, 45, all from
OL,12,FLewisham in south-east London, were
OL,13,Fjailed at Woolwich Crown Court in
OL,14,FApril.
OL,16,FAttorney General Ellie Reeves referred
OL,17,Fthe sentences to the Court of Appeal as
OL,18,Funduly lenient.
OL,20,FOn Thursday, judges added three years
OL,21,Fto German's term, two and a half years
OL,22,Fto Wint's and two years to Smith's.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
